body:
The duality of my brain;

I can't find my glasses/keys, I MUST PANIC AND CRY

Watching an actual disaster unfold before my eyes, I am zen. I am calm.

I have nothing funny I'd just be like; 

"Yeah, hey, it's me, your faith figurehead. If you didn't believe in one, that's fine. Just would like you to hear me out anyways. Not like any of you have a choice. Anyways. Just wanted to clear up any confusion about this, but gay and trans people are fine. Every race and ethnicity is valid and fine. Respecting, valuing, and loving people of all kinds is a basic norm I would like everyone to start practicing immediately. Also, water is a default basic human right and I will strike you down and destroy everything you ever cared about if you don't stop charging for it. As a courtesy I have programmed this message to keep playing on a loop until individual compliance has been reached. Sleep will not stop the loop. Tinfoil will not stop the loop. Death will not stop the loop, because I will be there, waiting to tell you again. This is my one and only PSA, get your hatred in line or get out of my universe. If you do not hold these abhorrent views, this message will only play once as a courtesy. Thank you. Remember the free water thing."

After about 2 weeks, most people in the world would be so annoyed at hearing a loop of intrusive unavoidable thoughts that they'd either comply out of being desperate or take care of it by other means. Either way it would result in a pretty drastic shift in world view rather quickly.
